# ==============================================================================
# oidc-agent-cli configuration
#
# This file contains a list of OpenID Connect (OIDC) provider endpoints and
# their associated metadata (registration URLs, contact emails).
# It is consumed by oidc-agent-cli to auto-discover or configure trusted
# identity providers.
#
# Format per line (space/tab separated):
#   1. Provider Base URL (e.g., https://provider.example.com/)
#   2. Dynamic Client Registration URL (optional, often /manage/dev/dynreg)
#   3. Support Contact Email (optional)
#
# Variables correspond to specific identity providers. All are optional with
# sensible defaults provided via Jinja2 `default()` filters.
# ==============================================================================

